# PlayerHeldJumpOff's arms (81:D5EC) no script ran: Aladdin jumps off kind
# $79 as in cov_kind79_let_go.box (it carries him from frame 35; B jumps him
# off while its pose, $2F, is 4 to $0C).
# A. Off high in the carry (71 frames on: pose $0A, y $9F), A (the throw) at once:
#    the throw starts (81:D66B), AIR_THROW counts down to 0 in the air
#    (81:D65B-D665).
# B. HOVER_ON ($036E) poked to 1 as in cov_hover.box, R (the fourth
#    action) held through the fall: on at PlayerHover (81:D685-D690).
# C. V_1428 set three frames into the jump, as an actor he lands on sets
#    it (land_on_actor.asm): TILE_BITS 0, on at PlayerLand (81:D640).
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s1.state
hold Y+RIGHT 23
hold RIGHT 13
hold LEFT 50
hold DOWN+A 14
poke 0008E7 F0,00
poke 0008EA C0,00
wait 71
press B
press A
wait 60
